+request before aj could see them; aj asked to review the code itself before it is written. The
+first drafts used names like `_rc` and wrapped mid-word, which aj could not read; aj chose a
+check that refuses unreadable code before they see it, because friction makes review easy to
+skip (aj, 2026-11-04, "Design approved: code preview and issue rule 1A 2A 3B 4A" and
